    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game about building and exploring connections.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique and vibrant world, meeting diverse characters while you explore and build connections with the community. <i>A game selected in the first Outersloth (Innersloth Development Fund) group!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/4dcc40072f51aee3ef4cb669f652b5e0.avif?t=1727670008\" width=219 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/437b5b7977295e1143b0393532394e8f.avif?t=1727670008\" width=336 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game filled with captivating locations, items and people. Learn to master the Fivehold Factor as you build a mental model of the fantastical world around you.<br><br>Speak with people to learn about the world as it is, as it was, and as it will be. Become part of the community to learn even more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> and <strong>Destroy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deconstruct abandoned LiFE corporation facilities and re-purpose their parts to build and replace essential structures in the community.<br><br><strong>A roving research lab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride around with your ROV-R research lab as you uncover depth, discover mystery, and unravel what The Mossfield Archives contains. Research new technology to solve problems and reshape your daily life. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/11e9c2884a52d69c20ac112833d1d52e.poster.avif?t=1727670008\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/11e9c2884a52d69c20ac112833d1d52e.webm?t=1727670008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/11e9c2884a52d69c20ac112833d1d52e.mp4?t=1727670008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game about building and exploring connections.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique and vibrant world, meeting diverse characters while you explore and build connections with the community. <i>A game selected in the first Outersloth (Innersloth Development Fund) group!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/4dcc40072f51aee3ef4cb669f652b5e0.avif?t=1727670008\" width=219 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/437b5b7977295e1143b0393532394e8f.avif?t=1727670008\" width=336 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game filled with captivating locations, items and people. Learn to master the Fivehold Factor as you build a mental model of the fantastical world around you.<br><br>Speak with people to learn about the world as it is, as it was, and as it will be. Become part of the community to learn even more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> and <strong>Destroy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deconstruct abandoned LiFE corporation facilities and re-purpose their parts to build and replace essential structures in the community.<br><br><strong>A roving research lab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride around with your ROV-R research lab as you uncover depth, discover mystery, and unravel what The Mossfield Archives contains. Research new technology to solve problems and reshape your daily life. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/11e9c2884a52d69c20ac112833d1d52e.poster.avif?t=1727670008\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/11e9c2884a52d69c20ac112833d1d52e.webm?t=1727670008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950830/extras/11e9c2884a52d69c20ac112833d1d52e.mp4?t=1727670008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
